# Task README: Configure Apache on Container in App Server 3

## Overview
This README documents the steps required to install and configure the Apache HTTP server inside the `kkloud` container running on Application Server 3 (`stapp03`) in the Stratos Datacenter as part of [Project Nautilus](https://kodekloudhub.github.io/kodekloud-engineer/docs/projects/nautilus#infrastructure-details).

